OL,6,
OL,7,FDuring a news conference in Oslo after
OL,8,Fmeeting with US special envoy Steve
OL,9,FWitkoff, Zelensky also says he is
OL,10,F"ready for negotiations" and calls for
OL,11,Ftrilateral talks with the US and Russia
OL,12,F- here's what we heard
OL,14,FSpeaking from the White House, US
OL,15,FPresident Donald Trump says it is "now
OL,16,Ftime for Ukraine to end this war"
OL,18,FWitkoff will meet with Russian
OL,19,Fleadership tomorrow and "exchange
OL,20,Fideas", Norway's PM Jonas Gahr StC8re
OL,21,Fsays at the conference
